{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50634","headline":"题云居上寺 · 吉播","name":"题云居上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石路多奇迹，幽岩凿宝经。\n暮烟千壑里，新月一山明。\n宿鸟知清梵，樵人惯独行。\n爲随欢奉後，岂敢学逃[名]。\n（见《金石萃编》卷一百五。\n）（缺文据吉逾条下所引诸书补。\n）（按诗次吉騊駼诗後，原题曰「同前」，下署「□上」，盖名已摩灭。\n据吉逾诗序，知爲其犹子吉播所赋。\n诗中「暮烟」，石刻原作「暮烟」，王昶谓是笔误，今据正。\n〖1〗吉播，原作吉潜，详前吉逾条附考。\n前引诸书及《八琼室金石补正》卷六五此诗末署名皆作「播上」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉播","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}